  "details": "While the new patch fixes clicks being outright dropped, I've noticed many times that actions are \"doubled\" instead now. For example, in the action menu, i will try to go into tools and it'll instantly jump to camera. Happens for all other UI elements as well. Another example, for the quick menu, I will open the worlds tab then it'll instantly double click and pull up some random world.\n\nI've tried using other mice, and friends have been having similar issues who are also on 1917, and did not have the issue on earlier builds.",
